        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "L. An appeal to arbitration shall not constitute a bar to efforts by the University and AFSCME to achieve resolution of the grievance appealed to arbitration during the time the appeal is pending and until such time that an arbitrator has rendered his or her decision.",
            "block_bbox": [
                111,
                97,
